msgid ""
"Thanks to your donation to the General Fund, through your help we can "
"offer<br>                a concrete help and a new future to many children "
"on the field and restore hope in their lives."
msgstr ""
"Grâce à votre don au fonds général, nous pouvons offrir<br>                "
"une aide concrète et un nouvel avenir à de nombreux enfants sur le terrain "
